# UI

Shared components live in `frontend/src/components/`. Copy uses glossary terms.

- The list filters by make, model, stock state, stocked-out on, and aging. Aging rows follow `is_aging`. Stocked-out rows stay visually distinct.
- The primary image uses the same-origin API URL, or a placeholder when `has_primary_image` is false.
- Stock-out, proposed action, and image are separate controls.
- Field errors are inline. Success and failure use a toast.

Change markup only when the API cannot express the feature, and reuse the existing spacing, type, and components.
